---
---

<div class="page-shell">
<div class="hero-panel">
<div class="hero-copy">
<p class="eyebrow">Event-Buchungstool Demo</p>
<h1>GasConnect</h1>
<p class="hero-text">
Ein Mockup für ein einfaches Event-Buchungs-Tool mit Fokus auf Gasversorgung, Pipeline-Management
und Branchentreffen der Energiebranche.
</p>
<div class="hero-actions">
<a class="cta-button" href="#events">Events ansehen</a>
<a class="secondary-button" href="#admin">Admin-Bereich</a>
</div>
</div>

<div class="hero-preview">
<div class="preview-card">
<span class="badge">Demo</span>
<h2>Nutze den visuellen Prototyp</h2>
<p>Zeige Event-Highlights, Verfügbarkeit und wichtige Admin-Informationen, ohne Backend.</p>
<ul>
<li>Eventlisting mit Preisen</li>
<li>Live-Status und Verfügbarkeit</li>
<li>Admin-Bereich für Event-Updates</li>
<li>Mobile und Desktop Mockup</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<section id="events" class="section-block">
<div class="section-header">
<p class="section-label">Branchenevents Gasversorgung</p>
<h2>Unsere wichtigsten Gas- & Energieveranstaltungen</h2>
<p class="section-copy">
Durchsuche Events aus der Gasbranche, entdecke Fachkonferenzen und buche deinen Platz für
Netzwerk und Austausch. Dieses Mockup zeigt das Erlebnis, ohne echte Buchungslogik.
</p>
</div>

<div class="grid-list">
<article class="event-card">
<div class="event-meta">
<span>Fachkonferenz</span>
<strong>Pipeline-Sicherheit 2026</strong>
</div>
<p class="event-description">Strategien für Leckageerkennung, Wartung und digitale Überwachung von Gasinfrastruktur.</p>
<div class="event-details">
<span>24. Mai · 18:00</span>
<span>89 €</span>
</div>
<div class="event-status">
<span class="pill available">Noch 12 Plätze</span>
<a class="action-link" href="#">Ticket reservieren</a>
</div>
</article>

<article class="event-card highlighted">
<div class="event-meta">
<span>Roundtable</span>
<strong>Smart Gas Networks</strong>
</div>
<p class="event-description">Diskussion zu digitaler Vernetzung von Gasnetz, IoT-Sensorik und Energiemanagement.</p>
<div class="event-details">
<span>28. Mai · 20:00</span>
<span>119 €</span>
</div>
<div class="event-status">
<span class="pill sold">Begrenzt verfügbar</span>
<a class="action-link" href="#">Jetzt Platz sichern</a>
</div>
</article>

<article class="event-card">
<div class="event-meta">
<span>Hybrid Event</span>
<strong>Gashandel & Marktanalyse</strong>
</div>
<p class="event-description">Analyse von Markttrends, Kapazitätsplanung und Preisentwicklung im EU-Gassektor.</p>
<div class="event-details">
<span>31. Mai · 16:00</span>
<span>39 €</span>
</div>
<div class="event-status">
<span class="pill available">Online + vor Ort</span>
<a class="action-link" href="#">Mehr erfahren</a>
</div>
</article>
</div>
</section>

<section id="admin" class="section-block admin-block">
<div class="section-header">
<p class="section-label">Admin-Dashboard</p>
<h2>Veranstaltungen schnell bearbeiten</h2>
<p class="section-copy">
Ein teasender Admin-Bereich zeigt, wie Eventdaten, Reservierungen und Kapazitäten gepflegt werden können.
</p>
</div>

<div class="admin-grid">
<div class="admin-card">
<h3>Event bearbeiten</h3>
<p>Update Titel, Datum, Preis und Verfügbarkeit für Gasversorgungs-Events mit einer klaren Oberfläche.</p>
<ul>
<li>Event-Status</li>
<li>Preis & Kapazität</li>
<li>Beschreibungen</li>
</ul>
<a class="action-link" href="#">Event bearbeiten</a>
</div>

<div class="admin-card">
<h3>Reservierungen</h3>
<p>Behalte den Überblick über Buchungen, Abmeldungen und Gästelisten.</p>
<ul>
<li>Letzte Buchungen</li>
<li>Status-Updates</li>
<li>Teilnehmer-Statistik</li>
</ul>
<a class="action-link" href="#">Reservierungen ansehen</a>
</div>

<div class="admin-card summary-card">
<h3>Dashboard-Vorschau</h3>
<div class="metric-row">
<div>
<span>120+</span>
<p>Reservierungen</p>
</div>
<div>
<span>4</span>
<p>Geplante Events</p>
</div>
<div>
<span>95%</span>
<p>Auslastung</p>
</div>
</div>
<p class="small-copy">Admins können hier neue Events veröffentlichen oder bestehende Buchungen verwalten.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</div>

<style>
.page-shell {
position: relative;
padding: 40px clamp(20px, 4vw, 80px);
max-width: 1240px;
margin: 0 auto;
min-height: 100vh;
}

.hero-panel {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
gap: 32px;
align-items: center;
padding: 48px 0;
}

.hero-copy {
max-width: 560px;
}

.eyebrow {
text-transform: uppercase;
letter-spacing: 0.2em;
color: #a5b4fc;
font-size: 0.85rem;
margin-bottom: 18px;
}

h1 {
font-size: clamp(3rem, 4vw, 4.5rem);
line-height: 0.95;
margin: 0;
max-width: 12ch;
}

.hero-text {
margin: 24px 0;
max-width: 42rem;
font-size: 1.15rem;
line-height: 1.8;
color: #e2e8f0;
}

.hero-actions {
display: flex;
flex-wrap: wrap;
gap: 16px;
}

.cta-button,
.secondary-button {
display: inline-flex;
align-items: center;
justify-content: center;
padding: 16px 24px;
border-radius: 14px;
font-weight: 700;
text-decoration: none;
}

.cta-button {
background: linear-gradient(90deg, #6366f1 0%, #8b5cf6 100%);
color: white;
box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.16);
}

.secondary-button {
background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
color: #f8fafc;
}

.hero-preview {
display: grid;
place-items: center;
}

.preview-card {
background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.92);
border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
border-radius: 32px;
padding: 32px;
max-width: 480px;
box-shadow: 0 40px 80px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4);
}

.badge {
display: inline-flex;
padding: 8px 14px;
border-radius: 999px;
background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.18);
color: #c7d2fe;
font-size: 0.85rem;
font-weight: 700;
margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.preview-card h2 {
margin: 0 0 14px;
font-size: 1.8rem;
}

.preview-card p {
margin: 0 0 20px;
line-height: 1.75;
color: #cbd5e1;
}

.preview-card ul {
list-style: none;
padding: 0;
margin: 0;
display: grid;
gap: 12px;
}

.preview-card li {
padding-left: 24px;
position: relative;
color: #e2e8f0;
}

.preview-card li::before {
content: '✓';
position: absolute;
left: 0;
color: #7c3aed;
}

.section-block {
padding: 48px 0;
}

.section-header {
max-width: 760px;
margin-bottom: 28px;
}

.section-label {
text-transform: uppercase;
letter-spacing: 0.24em;
color: #a5b4fc;
font-size: 0.8rem;
margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.section-header h2 {
font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 3vw, 3rem);
margin: 0 0 16px;
}

.section-copy {
margin: 0;
color: #cbd5e1;
line-height: 1.8;
}

.grid-list {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
gap: 24px;
}

.event-card,
.admin-card {
background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
border-radius: 28px;
padding: 28px;
display: flex;
flex-direction: column;
gap: 18px;
}

.event-card.highlighted {
background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.16), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95));
border-color: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.4);
}

.event-meta span {
text-transform: uppercase;
font-size: 0.8rem;
letter-spacing: 0.18em;
color: #818cf8;
}

.event-meta strong {
display: block;
font-size: 1.45rem;
line-height: 1.15;
margin-top: 6px;
}

.event-description {
margin: 0;
color: #cbd5e1;
line-height: 1.8;
}

.event-details {
display: flex;
justify-content: space-between;
font-weight: 700;
color: #e2e8f0;
}

.event-status {
display: flex;
justify-content: space-between;
align-items: center;
gap: 16px;
}

.pill {
display: inline-flex;
padding: 8px 14px;
border-radius: 999px;
font-size: 0.85rem;
font-weight: 700;
}

.pill.available {
background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.12);
color: #86efac;
}

.pill.sold {
background: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.13);
color: #fda4af;
}

.action-link {
color: #c4b5fd;
font-weight: 700;
text-decoration: none;
}

.action-link:hover {
text-decoration: underline;
}

.admin-grid {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
gap: 24px;
}

.summary-card {
background: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.18);
}

.summary-card h3 {
margin: 0;
}

.summary-card .metric-row {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
gap: 16px;
}

.summary-card .metric-row div {
background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7);
padding: 18px;
border-radius: 18px;
}

.summary-card .metric-row span {
display: block;
font-size: 1.6rem;
font-weight: 800;
color: #ffffff;
}

.summary-card .metric-row p,
.small-copy {
margin: 8px 0 0;
color: #cbd5e1;
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
.hero-panel,
.grid-list,
.admin-grid {
grid-template-columns: 1fr;
}

.hero-panel {
gap: 20px;
}
}

@media (max-width: 680px) {
.page-shell {
padding: 24px 16px 32px;
}

.hero-copy {
text-align: center;
}

.hero-actions {
justify-content: center;
}

.preview-card {
padding: 24px;
}

.event-details,
.event-status {
flex-direction: column;
align-items: flex-start;
}
}
</style>
